OL,3,GNEWSAHow does Peterborough Local Plan
OL,4,Aaffect residents?
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt more than 200 pages, Peterborough's
OL,7,FLocal Plan is roughly the size of a
OL,8,Fsmall novel.
OL,10,FIt may not be on everybody's summer
OL,11,Freading list, but the document is a
OL,12,Fblueprint for the future - setting out
OL,13,Fwhere thousands of homes could be built
OL,14,Fand jobs could be developed in the
OL,15,Fcity.
OL,17,FAs it enters its final stages, we ask
OL,18,Fwhat it means for residents and take a
OL,19,Flook at the plans for the future.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
